                            	  2136: DrawStatusBarItemsAndEnsureItemSelected:
                            	  2137:     ; Draws the selected item and the sword in the status bar.
                            	  2138:     ; Before drawing the item, it ensures that SelectedItemSlot
                            	  2139:     ; refers to an occupied, equippable item slot.
                            	  2140:     ;
                            	  2141:     ; This accounts for the fallback behavior between potions
